# OR-010: Explicit alcohol oxidation is a requested model, not spontaneous vinegar formation
# Candidate experiment; expected observations are not measured results.
register lv3
add v1 water 20mL
seal v1 500mL
add v1 ethanol 0.001mol
add v1 O2 0.01mol
new
add v2 water 20mL
seal v2 500mL
add v2 ethanol 0.001mol
add v2 O2 0.01mol
wait 60s
inspect
react v1 alcohol-oxidation
inspect
